WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.200
-It's time for "Tonight Show
Stocking Stuffers"!

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.868
Here we go!
-♪ "Tonight Show" ♪

00:00:04.868 --> 00:00:05.968
-♪ Stocking Stuffers ♪

00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:07.434
-♪ It's the "Tonight Show" ♪

00:00:07.434 --> 00:00:08.634
-♪ Stocking Stuffers ♪

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:12.534
-♪ Stocking Stuffers ♪

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:14.567
-Every night until
Christmas break,

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:16.133
we're giving away an
incredible gift

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.634
to every single person
in our studio audience.

00:00:18.634 --> 00:00:19.834
Are you guys ready for this?

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:21.334
Ready to see
what you're taking home?

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:24.067
Questlove, drumroll, please.
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:26.968
Tonight's stocking stuffer is a

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:32.033
House of Marley Get Together 2
mini wireless Bluetooth speaker!

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:33.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.734
Yes, Jimmy,
created in collaboration with

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.167
the Marley family, the
House of Marley Get Together 2

00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:37.834
mini wireless
dust- and water-proof speaker

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:39.267
is crafted with natural bamboo

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:42.300
and REWIND fabric created from
99% post-consumer materials.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.601
The speakers boast 15 hours of
perfectly balanced sound,

00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:46.033
making it excellent
for any adventure.

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:48.234
Head to houseofmarley.com
to get yours!

00:00:48.234 --> 00:00:49.300
Jimmy?

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.133
-Thank you very much, Higgins.

00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:52.567
Look at this.

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:55.534
Look at the woofer on this.
Look at the bass on this guy.

00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:57.534
Ooh!
[ Imitates bass thumping ]

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:01.534
Yeah.

00:01:01.534 --> 00:01:02.801
How about we test
these guys out?

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:04.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:05.567
You guys want to hear
how they sound?

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:07.100
Here we go. Let's go.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:11.067
-♪ There are times
when I look above and beyond ♪

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:13.767
♪ There are times when I
feel your arms around me, baby ♪

00:01:13.767 --> 00:01:17.100
[ Crowd cheering ]

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:23.400
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:27.734
-What -- what is going on?!

00:01:27.734 --> 00:01:30.033
Janet Jackson!
-Jimmy...

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:32.901
-Janet Jackson is in the house!

00:01:32.901 --> 00:01:35.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:41.300
-I see you on this.
What are you doing?

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:45.000
-Janet, what are you doing here?
What are you --

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.334
-Listen, I start my new tour,
"Together Again," in April,

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:50.634
and I was looking for someone
to come onstage

00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:52.067
and dance with me
at Madison Square Garden.

00:01:52.067 --> 00:01:54.334
-And you --
So, you saw my dance moves

00:01:54.334 --> 00:01:56.234
and you, like,
want me to go on tour?

00:01:56.234 --> 00:01:57.701
This right there?

00:01:57.701 --> 00:02:00.701
I'm a little stiff, but, yeah.
You're looking for dancers?

00:02:00.701 --> 00:02:01.801
-Yes.
-You're looking for --

00:02:01.801 --> 00:02:03.467
-No, that ain't gonna
make it, Jimmy.

00:02:03.467 --> 00:02:04.467
-I'm not going to make it.
Thank you very much.

00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:05.667
I appreciate it. I was trying --

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.667
-No, but, listen, I would love
to see if someone

00:02:07.667 --> 00:02:09.167
from the audience wants to try.

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:10.434
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah?

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:13.300
-Does someone want to dance
with Janet Jackson?

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:14.801
You, sir,
in the hat right there.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:16.133
Why don't you pick one,
and I'll pick one.

00:02:16.133 --> 00:02:17.834
You -- How about that guy
with the hat?

00:02:17.834 --> 00:02:19.801
-Okay.
-I think he should come down.

00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:21.634
Yeah, I think so.
♪♪

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:24.534
And who else?

00:02:24.534 --> 00:02:26.033
-The girl with the black shirt.

00:02:26.033 --> 00:02:27.767
-In the black shirt, yes.
Come on down.

00:02:27.767 --> 00:02:29.934
-Whoo!

00:02:29.934 --> 00:02:31.901
-Welcome. Hi.

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:33.667
Hello. What is your name?

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:35.534
-Jenny Mariani! Hi!

00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:37.767
-Hi! Where are you --
-Whoo-hoo!

00:02:37.767 --> 00:02:39.334
[ Cheers and applause ]
-What is your name?

00:02:39.334 --> 00:02:42.167
-Jeff. Jeff Cherry.
Jenny looks like a real dancer.

00:02:42.167 --> 00:02:43.701
-She does?
-Thank you.

00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:45.267
-No, I think you look like
a real dancer, too.

00:02:45.267 --> 00:02:47.501
I mean, come on.
I can see some moves here.

00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:49.434
Alright, now, Janet,
do they need to know anything

00:02:49.434 --> 00:02:50.801
before they dance for you?

00:02:50.801 --> 00:02:54.133
-No, no. Just freestyle.
Just do what you want to do.

00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:55.267
Just --
No, seriously, freestyle.

00:02:55.267 --> 00:02:56.400
-Here we go. This is freestyle.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:57.400
Let's play a little
"Together Again"

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.801
for them right now.

00:02:58.801 --> 00:03:02.434
-♪ There are times
when I look above and beyond ♪

00:03:02.434 --> 00:03:06.968
♪ There are times when I
feel your arms around me, baby ♪

00:03:06.968 --> 00:03:10.000
-No, hey, that's not bad.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.234
I mean...

00:03:11.234 --> 00:03:12.801
And a spin.

00:03:12.801 --> 00:03:14.434
A lot of spins
going around there, too.

00:03:14.434 --> 00:03:16.267
-Come on.
-I can do that spin.

00:03:16.267 --> 00:03:19.400
Alright, I like that.
Alright, I think that's good.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.300
Janet, what do you think?
Do they have what it takes?

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.400
-You know what?

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.100
I would love for
both of you guys

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.701
to come and
dance with me onstage, yeah?

00:03:26.701 --> 00:03:28.701
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.567
As a matter of fact,
I would love to give

00:03:33.567 --> 00:03:36.100
tickets to everybody here
in the audience

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:37.968
for the
Madison Square Garden show.

00:03:37.968 --> 00:03:39.601
-Oh, my God! Come on, now!

00:03:39.601 --> 00:03:41.868
[ Cheers and applause ]
That's what I'm talking about!

00:03:41.868 --> 00:03:45.434
You're all getting tickets to
see Janet Jackson

00:03:45.434 --> 00:03:48.834
on her "Together Again" tour
at Madison Square Garden!

00:03:48.834 --> 00:03:50.567
What a night this is!

00:03:50.567 --> 00:03:52.501
Janet Jackson, everybody!

00:03:52.501 --> 00:03:53.801
You can get presale tickets to

00:03:53.801 --> 00:03:55.601
her "Together Again" tour
right now.

00:03:55.601 --> 00:03:57.801
Tickets officially
go on sale tomorrow.

00:03:57.801 --> 00:04:00.200
We'll be right back with more of
"The Tonight Show"!

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:03.234
-What was that?
♪♪

